# Pairs with NoKeyLost. A write is acknowledged but does not enter either leaf.
MODULE: WriteDoesNotAckUnstoredKey
TARGET: NoKeyLost
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an acknowledged key is absent from every leaf
PERTURBS: Write

--- FIND
    /\ acked' = acked \cup {k}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: acknowledge without storing.
    /\ acked' = acked
--- END
